# staged audio/archive binaries and local film renders (sidecars *.json, *.md, *.txt stay trackable)
media/music-staging/**/*.mp3
media/music-staging/**/*.ogg
media/music-staging/**/*.wav
media/music-staging/**/*.flac
media/music-staging/**/*.m4a
